elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI向欧盟开放GPT-5.5-Cyber模型以强化网络安全防御</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD发布vLLM-ATOM插件，深度优化Instinct GPU大模型推理性能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">防篡位“金身”：OpenAI悄然改章程大幅提升罢免奥特曼难度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c837f4493d467314bec37c70ee75d9b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">防篡位“金身”：OpenAI悄然改章程大幅提升罢免奥特曼难度AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 12, 202628在经历了 2023 年的“政变”风波后，OpenAI近期通过修改公司章程，为其首席执行官萨姆·奥特曼筑起了一道坚固的防御墙。根据最新曝光的法庭文件，奥特曼如今在公司内部的地位已稳如泰山，外部干预或董事会内部罢免的门槛被大幅拉高。马斯克起诉OpenAI案件的专家证人指出，这些变动是在公司向营利性转型期间悄悄完成的。相较于过去简单多数票即可解雇CEO的规则，新规则实质上赋予了奥特曼极强的留任保障。从简单多数到绝对多数 根据去年 10 月通过的新章程，若要罢免CEO，必须获得公共利益公司（PBC）非员工董事三分之二以上的“绝对多数”同意。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌地图将深度集成Gemini AI助手，Apple CarPlay导航体验迎来升级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3cd792550006727bcf3d9fb57d360f8f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正计划为Apple CarPlay版本的谷歌地图引入Gemini AI助手，旨在将车载导航从传统工具升级为具备深度理解能力的智能副驾。该功能得益于iOS 26.4版本对第三方语音对话类应用的开放，允许Gemini与CarPlay进行深层集成。目前，相关代码框架已内置于谷歌地图应用中，用户在手机端同意更新服务条款后即可解锁支持。与以往仅支持基础语音指令不同，Gemini将支持对话式交互，驾驶者可直接询问目的地细节或获取出行建议。目前该功能正处于测试阶段，预计将在完成测试后通过版本更新向全球用户推送。随着ChatGPT、Grok及Perplexity等AI服务相继接入，CarPlay生态的智能化进程显著加速，车载系统正向深度理解能力的智能交互终端转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI向欧盟开放GPT-5.5-Cyber模型以强化网络安全防御</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0774671555f10ec41adc9f0a5f858c53.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式宣布向欧盟开放其最先进的网络安全大模型GPT-5.5-Cyber，访问权限精准覆盖企业、政府机构、网络安全专家及欧盟AI办公室。此举旨在利用该模型的深度分析能力应对复杂网络威胁，并提升全球网络防御合作水平。欧盟委员会对此表示欢迎，认为该模型的透明度有助于监管部门实时跟踪部署情况并降低潜在风险。相比之下，竞争对手Anthropic的网络安全模型Mythos目前尚未获得欧盟市场准入。尽管Anthropic已与欧盟进行了四至五轮密集磋商，但进度仍停留在程序层面，远落后于OpenAI。此次合规进度差异直接影响了全球安全模型在欧洲市场的布局格局，凸显了OpenAI在跨境落地与监管合规方面的领先优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD发布vLLM-ATOM插件，深度优化Instinct GPU大模型推理性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/eb601e68452e54456a876493c6baf337.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD正式发布vLLM-ATOM插件，旨在无需修改现有API接口或工作流的前提下，显著提升DeepSeek-R1、Kimi-K2及gpt-oss-120B等大模型的推理速度。该插件专为Instinct MI350、MI400及MI400X系列GPU打造，采用三层架构设计：顶层兼容vLLM调度，中间层负责模型实现与内核调优，底层AITER提供Flash Attention、量化GEMM及MoE融合等加速能力。vLLM-ATOM支持Qwen3、GLM、DeepSeek等多种架构，涵盖MoE、稠密模型及视觉语言模型（VLM）。通过“无感迁移”方案，企业可降低高性能算力部署门槛，在保持推理效率的同时，提升大模型在线服务的响应速度与稳定性，实现向AMD硬件后端的平滑切换。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
